/*

!/generator/
!/desktop/
!/docs/
!/scratch/
!/Design/
!/scripts/
!/.github/
!/.githooks/
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/CAPABILITIES.md
!/RELEASE-NOTES.md

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
**/binaries/node-*.exe
**/binaries/node-*
desktop/src-tauri/resources/gen/
desktop/resources/gen/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
generator/output/
**/output/
.thraksha/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/.env
**/.env.*
# ...but the .env.example under a plugin's templates/ is a committed, non-secret
# GENERATOR TEMPLATE (the build reads it at generation time). Track ONLY those
# (a fresh checkout must ship a complete generator); leave real .env secrets AND
# .env.example inside GENERATED output (e.g. */DemoApp/) ignored.
!**/templates/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets.*
